{"title": "Skinned Thumper", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Skinned Thumper</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skinned_Thumper.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Skinned Thumper.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Skinned_Thumper.jpg/250px-Skinned_Thumper.jpg?b574b3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Skinned_Thumper.jpg/375px-Skinned_Thumper.jpg?b574b3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Skinned_Thumper.jpg/500px-Skinned_Thumper.jpg?b574b3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nThumper</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nSkinnedThumper</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nMauling</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n40</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Skinned Thumper</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Thumper\">Thumper</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. As its name implies, it looks like a Thumper but has burnt, flayed, and red skin.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Skinned Thumper</b> behaves identical to the Thumper, rapidly accelerating while moving and decelerating when having to make turns while chasing a player. They spawn sequentially in the front-left, front-right, back-left, and back-right of the arena looking to the right, so players can wait behind where the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> will be spawned to avoid immediate detection and it will roam around aimlessly. However, it is often advised to be be seen by the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> to have more control over its movement.\n</p><p>Importantly, the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> has a Stun Time Multiplier of 1, meaning the base 2 second stun duration of the <b>Advanced nightstick</b> applies to the it. Typically the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> will break out of its stun after 3 hits for a brief second, so players should move slightly after each third hit to avoid accumulating damage and continue stunlocking it.\n</p><p>With the exception of the <b>Flamethrower</b> attack, many opporunities to attack a <b>Skinned Thumper</b> can be created either during or in-between <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Armory#&gt;_Event:_The_Exterminator\" title=\"Grand Armory\"><b>The Exterminator's</b></a> attacks with good positioning. The first <b>Skinned Thumper</b> can also be killed in one cycle before or right as <b>The Exterminator</b> is about to launch its first attack provided players immediately engage with it and do not miss a single hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p>Four <b>Skinned Thumpers</b> are dropped into the arena one-by-one after each one is killed during <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Armory#&gt;_Event:_The_Exterminator\" title=\"Grand Armory\"><b>The Exterminator</b></a> event in the <b>Grand Armory</b>. These spawns do no contribute to total Power Level, and the Max Count and Power Level of the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> only matter if players modify spawn tables to spawn the <b>Skinned Thumper</b> elsewhere.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Skinned Thumper <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Skinned Thumper<br /><br />[No information about this entity was found.]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stomping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"Stomp1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Stomp1.mp3?42f727\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Stomp1.mp3/Stomp1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"Stomp2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Stomp2.mp3?6fd05f\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" dat